  "model": "TopTronic E BACnet datapoints, use case 7 (heat generator, 3 circuits, hot water, buffer, ventilation)",
  "model_slug": "toptronic-e-bacnet-use-case-7",
  "aliases": [
    "Hoval use case 7",
    "Hoval Anwendungsfall 7",
    "TopTronic E use case 7",
    "TTE BACnet use case 7",
    "Hoval Connect BACnet"
  ],
  "equipment_type": "Boiler / heat generator monitoring (via BACnet gateway)",
  "applies_to": "Hoval TopTronic E systems with a heat generator, three heating circuits, hot water, a heating/cooling buffer and ventilation, read through an Intesis BACnet server polling Hoval Connect over Modbus TCP.",
  "summary": "Hoval's \"use case 7\" signal file maps 58 read-only analog inputs for monitoring a larger TopTronic E system: heat generator temperatures, modulation, status, hours, cycles, thermal and electrical power, COP, energy totals and heat pump fault code, plus flow, setpoint, mode and pump status per heating circuit, hot water and buffer tank temperatures, and ventilation mode, VOC, temperature and humidity.",
  "bacnet_transport": [],
  "firmware": null,
  "default_device_instance": null,
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "The file is an Intesis MAPS signals export (Modbus master to BACnet server) that Hoval publishes for its BACnet gateway; the mapping can be edited on site, so treat this as the factory default.",
    "Object names are the Name column (German); descriptions here are English translations. WEZ = heat generator, HK = heating circuit, WW = domestic hot water.",
    "All objects are AIs with no write function (monitoring only). Status, mode and fault values are numeric codes.",
    "The file sets units code 62 (°C) on every object, including hours, counts, power and COP; units are kept here only on temperature objects.",
    "Project name in the file: IN-BAC-MBM_Testanlage (a test installation), Intesis MAPS 1.2.33.0. The \"use case 3 and 4\" file only has 3 objects and is not listed.",
    "The file does not say whether the gateway serves BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP; check the gateway configuration."
  ],
